{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an easy-to-pick up, hard-to-put down game focused on the action of mining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Be sure to add it to your wishlist \u2014 you\u2019ll get a notification when it\u2019s released!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes you on an adventure across a variety of regions inspired by the real-world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From frozen mountains and arid deserts to mysterious jungles and the iconic cityscape of Paris, each location offers unique ores, environmental challenges, and secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only your trusty pickaxe in hand, you'll travel the world in search of treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the thrill of discovery and excavation in MINE THE WORLD's global mining adventure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3718380?t=1765901917","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718380/390e2cb3a4cf39d3c997e609ef3a330e1af3b042/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765901917","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718380/f8e15e578d1b10b109de4b65a5ee2af105feb01d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765901917","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718380/f8e15e578d1b10b109de4b65a5ee2af105feb01d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765901917","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an easy-to-pick up, hard-to-put down game focused on the action of mining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Be sure to add it to your wishlist \u2014 you\u2019ll get a notification when it\u2019s released!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes you on an adventure across a variety of regions inspired by the real-world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From frozen mountains and arid deserts to mysterious jungles and the iconic cityscape of Paris, each location offers unique ores, environmental challenges, and secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only your trusty pickaxe in hand, you'll travel the world in search of treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the thrill of discovery and excavation in MINE THE WORLD's global mining adventure.</p>","developers":["Brilliantcrypto, Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718380/89882687a82a87fa1cbc57f605a8c0b2a1d69e18/header.jpg?t=1765901917","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 Big Sur<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> HD Graphics 630 or higher</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3718380/585964397/b05778b28a102547c64e02cb934aea9f9570570b/1750407805/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750409215","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3718380/585964397/b05778b28a102547c64e02cb934aea9f9570570b/1750407805/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750409215","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3718380/585964397/b05778b28a102547c64e02cb934aea9f9570570b/1750407805/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750409215","id":257146365,"name":"MINE THE WORLD_Movie","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257146365/0d794759a60474eec19d9d6042795830c33bc06e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750409215"}],"name":"MINE THE WORLD","package_groups":[],"p